@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@alice = PASTE_ALICE_SESSION_TOKEN
@bob = PASTE_BOB_SESSION_TOKEN
@carol = PASTE_CAROL_SESSION_TOKEN
@purchaseID = replace-with-created-id
@aliceAccountID = replace-with-verified-account-id
@email = alice@example.test
@password = REPLACE_WITH_A_RANDOM_DEVELOPMENT_PASSPHRASE
@verification = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_LOOPBACK_MAILPIT
@recovery = PASTE_RECOVERY_TOKEN_FROM_LOOPBACK_MAILPIT

# Use a disposable database and Mailpit. Never save real credentials in this file.
# Enroll/verify/signin alone grant NO business membership. Run the trusted
# cmd/dev-fixtures command with four explicit account IDs as documented in README.

### Enrollment: 202 opaque accepted, challenge delivered only to local Mailpit.
POST {{base}}/auth/enroll
Origin: {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Explicit verification resend (supersedes previous token)
POST {{base}}/auth/verification
Origin: {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}"}

### Explicit POST confirmation; never consumes a token via GET.
POST {{base}}/auth/verify
Origin: {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"{{verification}}"}

### Sign in: copy Set-Cookie value into actor session variable. No JSON token.
POST {{base}}/auth/signin
Origin: {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Account ID for explicit trusted fixture binding (no tenant required)
GET {{base}}/auth/session
Cookie: __Host-pluto_session={{alice}}

### Request recovery (202 regardless of eligibility)
POST {{base}}/auth/recovery
Origin: {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}"}

### Reset revokes old sessions; sign in again afterwards.
POST {{base}}/auth/reset
Origin: {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"{{recovery}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Logout has no business tenant requirement; Origin still required.
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Origin: {{base}}
Cookie: __Host-pluto_session={{alice}}


### Organization display metadata; membership and permissions remain live.
GET {{base}}/api/organization
Cookie: __Host-pluto_session={{alice}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar

### Create a draft (201). Organization comes from verified membership, never body.
POST {{base}}/api/purchases
Idempotency-Key: action-11
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Annual microscope calibration","amount_cents":48000}

### Creator submits draft (200)
POST {{base}}/api/purchases/{{purchaseID}}/submit
Idempotency-Key: action-20
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar

### Another approver decides (200)
POST {{base}}/api/purchases/{{purchaseID}}/decision
Idempotency-Key: action-26
Authorization: Bearer {{bob}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"approved"}

### Alice's requests only
GET {{base}}/api/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar

### Same actor, another authorized organization: Northstar request is hidden (404)
GET {{base}}/api/purchases/{{purchaseID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
X-Organization-ID: harbor

### Client-visible flags (no-store); does not grant export permission
GET {{base}}/api/features
Authorization: Bearer {{bob}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar

### JSON export (403 unless startup feature is enabled)
GET {{base}}/api/purchases/export
Authorization: Bearer {{bob}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar
Accept-Encoding: gzip

### Personal audit history
GET {{base}}/api/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar

### Organization audit history
GET {{base}}/api/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{bob}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar

### Administrator lists organization members
GET {{base}}/api/memberships
Authorization: Bearer {{carol}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar

### Administrator changes another existing member's role
PATCH {{base}}/api/memberships/{{aliceAccountID}}
Idempotency-Key: action-71
Authorization: Bearer {{carol}}
X-Organization-ID: northstar
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"approver"}
